cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use AntibioticMech, please cite it.
title: >-
  AntibioticMech: a knowledge base of individual chemical structures with
  antimicrobial activity
abstract: >-
  AntibioticMech harmonizes ChEBI and CARD's Antibiotic Resistance Ontology into
  one evidence-backed, schema-validated YAML record per antimicrobial chemical
  structure, carrying identity, structure, activity class, molecular targets,
  resistance determinants and curated mechanism graphs.
authors:
  - name: AntibioticMech Contributors
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/AntibioticMech
type: dataset
keywords:
  - antibiotic
  - antimicrobial
  - mechanism of action
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - ChEBI
  - CARD
  - LinkML
  - knowledge graph
